OL,4,CProminent Zimbabwean preacher arrested 
OL,5,Con sexual assault allegations          
OL,6,GA well-known Zimbabwean preacher has   
OL,7,Gbeen arrested on indecent assault and  
OL,8,Gsodomy allegations, local police said. 
OL,10,FUebert Angel, who leads an             
OL,11,Finternational charismatic church with  
OL,12,Fbranches around the world, was         
OL,13,Farrested during a church service in    
OL,14,FHarare on Sunday. Pictures and footage 
OL,15,Fof the dramatic arrest have since been 
OL,16,Fcirculated online.                     
OL,18,FIn one video, a convoy of vehicles is  
OL,19,Fseen escorting the self-styled prophet 
OL,20,Fas he sits in the back of a police van 
OL,21,Fsurrounded by armed police officers.   
